#. module: nme_sales
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_sales
msgid ""
"=========================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Sales\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"Sales flow of Nusantara Mini ERP: quotation, sales order, delivery and\n"
"customer credit limits.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Quotations with per-line discounts and taxes, sent by email with the PDF\n"
"  attached (sending marks the quotation as sent).\n"
"* Strict state machine: Quotation, Quotation Sent, Sales Order, Cancelled.\n"
"  Confirmed lines are locked; cancelling requires a reason.\n"
"* Confirming an order creates the delivery of the goods (services are not\n"
"  delivered). The delivered quantity and the delivery status are computed\n"
"  from the stock ledger, returns included.\n"
"* **Credit limit** per customer and company with three policies:\n"
"\n"
"  * *No Limit*;\n"
"  * *Warn*: confirming above the limit is allowed and logged in the chatter;\n"
"  * *Block*: only a sales manager can confirm above the limit.\n"
"\n"
"  The credit used is computed by ``res.partner._get_credit_exposure``; this\n"
"  module counts confirmed orders and ``nme_invoicing`` refines it with\n"
"  unpaid invoices.\n"
"* Kanban by status, calendar of promised delivery dates, pivot and graph\n"
"  views, mass confirmation from the list and a printable quotation/order.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"*Nusantara ERP > Configuration > Settings*: default quotation validity.\n"
"Credit limits are set by sales managers on the customer form\n"
"(*Sales & Purchase* tab).\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Sales / User: Own Documents Only*: their own (or unassigned) orders;\n"
"  order lines follow their order through the ``access`` domain operator of\n"
"  ``ir.access``. They also prepare deliveries (outgoing transfers).\n"
"* *Sales / Manager*: every order, credit limits and limit overrides.\n"
"* Inventory users can read sales orders to prepare deliveries.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Penjualan\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Alur penjualan Nusantara Mini ERP: penawaran, pesanan penjualan, pengiriman\n"
"dan batas kredit pelanggan.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"* Penawaran dengan diskon dan pajak per baris, dikirim melalui email dengan\n"
"  PDF terlampir (pengiriman menandai penawaran sebagai terkirim).\n"
"* Alur status yang ketat: Penawaran, Penawaran Terkirim, Pesanan Penjualan,\n"
"  Dibatalkan. Baris yang sudah dikonfirmasi dikunci; pembatalan wajib disertai\n"
"  alasan.\n"
"* Konfirmasi pesanan membuat pengiriman barang (jasa tidak dikirim). Jumlah\n"
"  terkirim dan status pengiriman dihitung dari buku besar stok, termasuk retur.\n"
"* **Batas kredit** per pelanggan dan perusahaan dengan tiga kebijakan:\n"
"\n"
"  * *Tanpa Batas*;\n"
"  * *Peringatkan*: konfirmasi di atas batas diizinkan dan dicatat di chatter;\n"
"  * *Blokir*: hanya manajer penjualan yang dapat mengkonfirmasi di atas batas.\n"
"\n"
"  Kredit terpakai dihitung oleh ``res.partner._get_credit_exposure``; modul ini\n"
"  menghitung pesanan yang sudah dikonfirmasi dan ``nme_invoicing``\n"
"  melengkapinya dengan faktur yang belum dibayar.\n"
"* Kanban per status, kalender tanggal pengiriman yang dijanjikan, tampilan\n"
"  pivot dan grafik, konfirmasi massal dari daftar, serta penawaran/pesanan\n"
"  yang dapat dicetak.\n"
"\n"
"Konfigurasi\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"*Nusantara ERP > Konfigurasi > Pengaturan*: masa berlaku penawaran default.\n"
"Batas kredit diatur oleh manajer penjualan pada form pelanggan\n"
"(tab *Penjualan & Pembelian*).\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Penjualan / Pengguna: Hanya Dokumen Sendiri*: pesanan miliknya sendiri\n"
"  (atau yang belum ditugaskan); baris pesanan mengikuti pesanannya melalui\n"
"  operator domain ``access`` pada ``ir.access``. Mereka juga menyiapkan\n"
"  pengiriman (transfer keluar).\n"
"* *Penjualan / Manajer*: semua pesanan, batas kredit dan pengecualian batas.\n"
"* Pengguna persediaan dapat membaca pesanan penjualan untuk menyiapkan\n"
"  pengiriman.\n"
"\n"
"Kontributor\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

